    "result": "Excellent! All tests pass. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Weekly Subscription Support Added\n\n\u2705 **Core functionality:**\n- `subtrack add \"Meal kit\" 59.90 --every week` now works\n- Weekly plans cost their price \u00d7 52 \u00f7 12 per month (\u20ac59.90/week = \u20ac259.56/month)\n- Charges occur every 7 days from the `--since` date\n- Works alongside existing monthly and yearly plans\n\n\u2705 **Key changes made:**\n\n1. **cycles.js** - Added weekly cycle with proper monthly cost calculations\n2. **bin/subtrack.js** - Updated CLI to accept `--every week` flag\n3. **renewals.js** - Enhanced to show all weekly charges within the window (not just the next one), plus fixed existing sorting bug\n4. **export.js** - Added weekly support to CSV export\n\n\u2705 **All 45 tests pass**, including:\n- 11 new tests covering weekly functionality\n- Edge cases like multiple charges within a window\n- Mixed scenarios with monthly, yearly, and weekly plans\n- CSV export validation\n\nThe feature is fully functional and ready to use!",
